<Base title="How ordering works | ScentHunt" robots="noindex,follow"><section class="policy-page"><span class="eyebrow">HOW ORDERING WORKS</span><h1>A little clarity goes a long way.</h1><h2>What are decants?</h2><p>Decants are smaller quantities transferred from an original fragrance bottle into a separate sample atomizer. The original manufacturer bottle is shown for identification only and is not included in the order.</p><h2>Orders and delivery</h2><p>This website is currently a pre-launch demonstration and does not accept purchases. Proposed minimum product order: AED {settings.minimumOrder}. Proposed delivery: AED {settings.deliveryFee} below AED {settings.freeDeliveryAt}; complimentary from AED {settings.freeDeliveryAt}. Prices and shipping terms will be verified before activation.</p><h2>Payments</h2><p>Ziina integration is planned but is not enabled. A payment link will only be supplied after merchant eligibility, fragrance acceptance and relevant commercial approvals are confirmed.</p><h2>Fragrance information</h2><p>Fragrance notes are editorial descriptions. Sample images and specifications must be verified against the actual products before launching.</p></section></Base>
